    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3fcd10146a75a05f1f72b95",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──所有赛马娘都怀抱过同一个梦想，\n想靠着这双脚征服蓝天下每一吋土地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8619527b9d5788012151e897594b91586929552c37f08bd56db8d47c49f9706f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
