    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9620fce40c5a24273b328c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想其中大部分最终都会认清\n这只是小孩子在做梦，选择闭上眼睛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8bfe76c44fa12ed0fd8fc0f02a2c487b4042f837a90038c2ec6dad0a87c5b8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
