    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9605f043bc4b0b1097de9b10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这之中有位勇敢的赛马娘，\n让观众见识到何谓浪漫。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dbedb6285228173392ca85ea909cde0c8429da459c6f6f79ec9b7cff9380548",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049310.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b39327afa63b4ccade45c5a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "过去比赛的实况",
      "source_fingerprint": "743e4c5fc57fa08331d634bb11b0e17e76ce64b92fd46b774351e52a2b88d03c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049310.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79178d75c8bcf357c882e348",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“来自日本的神鹰\n只差一步……只差那么一步\n就能咬到对手了！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdd7b5557be8c22be706fe491554119c2c8b4a0dd9e6dc83841ca6f3857e91d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049310.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:557e825ba6b6191d26bf5355",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本C结束后・照亮未来的光芒",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1c34ccf5a6884f72374d7596c0ed9f9c9e627fa0f34512e5f27fce38c001de3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
