    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f25ba0160ae2ab95361af329",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赌徒赛马娘中山庆典。\n她总是借由惊险刺激的赌局\n体验“活着”的感觉──",
      "source_fingerprint": "97c09b4157991006180f6249c93051c995edea430be424cbca056b3a72114c67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:363679390edac8b7cec7b5a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a636a0f5e518e15a16caaaaf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她闯入曾赢得“凯旋门赏”第二名\n“最接近世界赛马娘”──神鹰的记者会，\n向对方提出对决，最终惨败。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb0435be5fb856ed6a4db07a219bf73ee79dd74a6df884df8aeafb5c2da86da0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4d6c29b3920c2316184260c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:396a866ebf8d7411a418552f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "记者们对她投以好奇的目光，\n说她是做出“鲁莽”挑战的赛马娘。\n但就连这种评论都让她心生愉悦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a824f5e470f99084ca3d758c0e84b4eccf6bee14832300e2f9084e7fb8b75952",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e28613431a1aeaacf39d135b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fda80d7c01e13ec80da66929",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与一心追求最惊险刺激赌局的她，\n就此展开赢下世界的挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b72472a570f3382dd12d07386e9522500c9a2253eef2538c2b1965eec7773ee9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9c2b6e8b9308cc617a38dcd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7591a1826134b1d97e86828f36bd711a4d4812af85aff29bdb5fbf4f302218cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:474eff9f82089bb22cf16f84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049401.json",
      "json_path": [
