    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e3fa327b566e61023642ce5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了替中山庆典拟定最合适的战略，\n训练员想分析她的过去资料，\n于是向她以前的导师求助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46ae7840388bc126399b1c8db8864fc46cab42dfd0e8383e599f0b21ae34f94f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbd14af60c8bc8f347c0e9ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ce7cf8190abc9210cb51515",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，\n东瀛佐敦询问中山庆典有什么目标。\n……经典级整年要用来收集资讯，目标未定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a4142b88dea2850d1c40d63a8f8ac3f7f61ba0d8a5995561ef646418790139",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f3ac1362ef32112706c0bc6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09bb7f76300cfdd99563e18a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听她回答“目前没有任何目标”后，\n东瀛佐敦露出安心的笑容。\n那笑容让她感到疑惑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69249ef446f8d9f3771ac5679b64e1096237657ad39992a147f1d84d948f58e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049401.json",
      "json_path": [
