      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "导师说道“希望能让人生存下去”。\n无论赢得“凯旋门赏”之路再严峻，\n只要心中有希望就能充满生气地活着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "246d446460648041857ba9c9eee93eb620be1a1274529fe265effb2b9864f553",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
