      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她将利用这一年，让自己成为帮助老师\n活下去的希望。还要让老师说出想\n亲眼看看自己参加“凯旋门赏”的模样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a186f232352a7f19dd418b6793425131c3832ee0011f9fdf072de5be757fc11a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
