      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先得在“皋月赏”缔造好成绩。\n一定能借此帮助以前的导师涌现动力。\n正如同她说“希望能让人生存下去”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "536eab912df502ec48591c650c44c9765ddd3b94d92933e5e73e85ee2616c31f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
