      "source_text": "是时候填写“凯旋门赏”报名登记表了。\n训练员与中山庆典自认\n“已尽最大的努力做好充足的准备”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84fff33c6371222cf28843a18629c9536cdf66d2fe0e436b0bcba827966f38df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049405.json",
      "json_path": [
