    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8d18429816199b23cee02f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年也到了夏季集训的季节。\n即将同场竞争“日本杯”的劲敌神鹰，\n将状态调整得非常完美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "098ab9f6ffdacdfcad31bc5b3f96a387b1ee8d413663b69560eb54091ab743ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049407.json",
      "json_path": [
