    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8b9779effe8abe0a8eb17f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "站上赛场即可感受到针对性的目光。\n紧盯着中山庆典的不知究竟是记者们？\n还是同日出道的赛马娘们？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aa6a92262370889451aff188da3de85d74b37294ff218c651ff5cd615ce68d3",
